              </?01M05F1PP0PR6C5E0WPGZ0HXSY>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.2" name = "实现模型能力传播与 planner gate" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PP0PR6C5E0WPGZ0HXSZ>
            扩展 provider config/capabilities/catalog，删除 TUI 硬编码，并在 request observation/I/O 前校验 canonical modalities、MIME 与大小；拒绝时发布脱敏 semantic diagnostic。
